# ── Internal notes — NEVER commit to this PUBLIC repo ──────────────────────
# Handoff / static-memory / optimization / deployment notes can carry infra
# secrets (server IPs, wallets, ntfy topics). They belong in local files only.
# (Operator-mandated after the 2026-06-21 HANDOFF_OPTIMIZATION.md leak.)
HANDOFF*.md
*HANDOFF*.md
*handoff*.md
*_handoff*
MEMORY.md
*-memory.md
*_memory.md
OPTIMIZATION_*.md
*_OPTIMIZATION.md
DEPLOY_NOTES*.md
/handoff/
/memory/
/.claude/

# release archives (build artifacts — never commit)
*-nvidia-release.zip

# Agent/session docs stay LOCAL — never publish to GitHub
STATIC_MEMORY.md
docs/KERNEL_SOLVER_AUDIT_*.md

# ── SESSION / AGENT DOCS — NEVER PUBLISH (this repo is PUBLIC) ──────────────
# These name local paths, rig hostnames, internal IPs and fleet topology.
# They live in $HOME, never in the repo. Deleting one in a later commit is NOT
# enough -- the adding commit still publishes it. Do not weaken these patterns.
*HANDOFF*
*STATIC_MEMORY*
*MEMORY.md
docs/*AUDIT*
docs/*_audit*
*-handoff.md
*.session.md
